(1035638, 123306, 6008, '<td valign="top">The idea is good/funny/clever - I think it was in the first humor challenge too. However, the background completely ruins it. I dont know if you were trying to go for tye-dye funky psychedelic or just messed up the saturation.</td>', 'The idea is good/funny/clever - I think it was in the first humor challenge too. However, the background completely ruins it. I dont know if you were trying to go for tye-dye funky psychedelic or just messed up the saturation.', '2004-11-29 00:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
