(1035645, 124290, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s fairly funny and doesnt really rely on the title although it does add to it. I actually thought of a goose/eagle pun thing before I noticed the title. Compositionally it''s ok and I think the goose peeking up from behind the slope adds to the humor also.</td>', 'It''s fairly funny and doesnt really rely on the title although it does add to it. I actually thought of a goose/eagle pun thing before I noticed the title. Compositionally it''s ok and I think the goose peeking up from behind the slope adds to the humor also.', '2004-11-29 00:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1035649, 124689, 6008, '<td valign="top">More bizarre than funny, I guess it depends on your sense of humor! I like the toning and the catchlight in the eye. The bushy eyebrows with the low lighting really makes it kinda evil scary. I think having a closer crop or else more negative space on the left would balance it up with the right a little.</td>', 'More bizarre than funny, I guess it depends on your sense of humor! I like the toning and the catchlight in the eye. The bushy eyebrows with the low lighting really makes it kinda evil scary. I think having a closer crop or else more negative space on the left would balance it up with the right a little.', '2004-11-29 00:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
