(1035754, 124662, 22384, '<td valign="top">Brilliant technical photo. The crisp images are captivating. I am not sure about the humor, though, but then humor is so subjective...</td>', 'Brilliant technical photo. The crisp images are captivating. I am not sure about the humor, though, but then humor is so subjective...', '2004-11-29 00:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1035757, 124485, 22384, '<td valign="top">Is there a way to make the cigar look more like it is lit. I think that a bright red cherry on the end would be an interesting element. But then I don''t know if cigars even have cherries on the end when lit. It would balance the eyes nicely if it did. The cropping of this phot makes me uneasy and feels incomplete with the cutting off of the chin. It distracts from the cigar for me.</td>', 'Is there a way to make the cigar look more like it is lit. I think that a bright red cherry on the end would be an interesting element. But then I don''t know if cigars even have cherries on the end when lit. It would balance the eyes nicely if it did. The cropping of this phot makes me uneasy and feels incomplete with the cutting off of the chin. It distracts from the cigar for me.', '2004-11-29 01:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1035759, 124258, 22384, '<td valign="top">Too cute. Okay, I am jealous that I didn''t think of something like this with these ubiiquitous kiddie plates. Brilliantly creative, nice execution of the idea, and very clever title.</td>', 'Too cute. Okay, I am jealous that I didn''t think of something like this with these ubiiquitous kiddie plates. Brilliantly creative, nice execution of the idea, and very clever title.', '2004-11-29 01:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
