(1036943, 124650, 3306, '<td valign="top">I''d have to say that overall this is the most creative, Humerous, and best photographed entry in the challenge. Congratulations!</td>', 'I''d have to say that overall this is the most creative, Humerous, and best photographed entry in the challenge. Congratulations!', '2004-11-29 21:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
