(1037031, 124278, 2223, '<td valign="top">LOL!!</td>', 'LOL!!', '2004-11-29 22:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037061, 123606, 22384, '<td valign="top">Simple and understated. Very elegant image in a challenge that has more than its share bad taste. Nicely done.</td>', 'Simple and understated. Very elegant image in a challenge that has more than its share bad taste. Nicely done.', '2004-11-29 23:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037063, 124677, 22384, '<td valign="top">Cute shot. Goats kinda freak me out, but you manage to make this one look friendly.</td>', 'Cute shot. Goats kinda freak me out, but you manage to make this one look friendly.', '2004-11-29 23:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037065, 124668, 22384, '<td valign="top">I am sorry, this is just a matter of taste, but I could have done without this shot. I know, I know, I am being unfairly prudish so I will evaluate this image based on technical merit.</td>', 'I am sorry, this is just a matter of taste, but I could have done without this shot. I know, I know, I am being unfairly prudish so I will evaluate this image based on technical merit.', '2004-11-29 23:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037070, 124574, 22384, '<td valign="top">This image is elegant but does not work as humor for me. The use of color, the moon and the black (night sky) is eye-catching.</td>', 'This image is elegant but does not work as humor for me. The use of color, the moon and the black (night sky) is eye-catching.', '2004-11-29 23:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037073, 124205, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and fun shot. The apple as your focal point, turned on its side, is clever. The shiny image in the background is distracting to me, and I would have liked the entire glass to be crystal clear and in focus. I think with those changes, this image would be a kicker.</td>', 'Interesting angle and fun shot. The apple as your focal point, turned on its side, is clever. The shiny image in the background is distracting to me, and I would have liked the entire glass to be crystal clear and in focus. I think with those changes, this image would be a kicker.', '2004-11-29 23:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037078, 124664, 22384, '<td valign="top">This looks almost exactly like my brother-in-law. Funny image. The cigarette and the expression great touches. Black and white is a great choice and I like that it is shot through the door to give the viewer the impression of spying on this guy. Great shot!</td>', 'This looks almost exactly like my brother-in-law. Funny image. The cigarette and the expression great touches. Black and white is a great choice and I like that it is shot through the door to give the viewer the impression of spying on this guy. Great shot!', '2004-11-29 23:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037081, 124650, 22384, '<td valign="top">Very funny. It is purrrfect (forgive the pun, but hey, if anyone can appreciate a pun, you can.) The fact that the light is on inside the scanner adss a great touch. Nice shot.</td>', 'Very funny. It is purrrfect (forgive the pun, but hey, if anyone can appreciate a pun, you can.) The fact that the light is on inside the scanner adss a great touch. Nice shot.', '2004-11-29 23:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037083, 124636, 22384, '<td valign="top">Funny shot, but it makes me oddly sad. I guess that there is a lot of sadness in most humor, though. There is a part of me which feels guilty when I laugh at another person''s face. Just a personal quirk, I guess.</td>', 'Funny shot, but it makes me oddly sad. I guess that there is a lot of sadness in most humor, though. There is a part of me which feels guilty when I laugh at another person''s face. Just a personal quirk, I guess.', '2004-11-29 23:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037089, 124045, 22384, '<td valign="top">I get cold just looking at this. The detail in the snow crystals is brilliant. The composition as a whole doesn''t work as well for me. I am not sure why. I like the framing and the cropping. I think it is that the colors are a bit too much like flesh and internal organs for me. It looks a bit like raw chicken meat and such.</td>', 'I get cold just looking at this. The detail in the snow crystals is brilliant. The composition as a whole doesn''t work as well for me. I am not sure why. I like the framing and the cropping. I think it is that the colors are a bit too much like flesh and internal organs for me. It looks a bit like raw chicken meat and such.', '2004-11-29 23:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037092, 123307, 22384, '<td valign="top">Funny idea, great backdrop and lighting. I would have liked the note to be made up of cut out magazine and newspaper letters.</td>', 'Funny idea, great backdrop and lighting. I would have liked the note to be made up of cut out magazine and newspaper letters.', '2004-11-29 23:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037096, 124096, 22384, '<td valign="top">I am a teacher so OBE (outcome based education) stuck in my mind. I did a google search and found out that it means out of body experience.  So, after some research, I get it, and it is a funny shot. Nice job.</td>', 'I am a teacher so OBE (outcome based education) stuck in my mind. I did a google search and found out that it means out of body experience.  So, after some research, I get it, and it is a funny shot. Nice job.', '2004-11-29 23:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037101, 123834, 22384, '<td valign="top">Brilliant observation. This is the kind of thing that people have to point out to me so kudos to you for noticing it. I really like the grays against the red and green in the sign. I am a little uneasy with the framing, but after looking at your image for a while, I am not sure how you could have changed it and still gotten your point across. I guess one has  to sacrifice some artistic merit for humor. Fun shot.</td>', 'Brilliant observation. This is the kind of thing that people have to point out to me so kudos to you for noticing it. I really like the grays against the red and green in the sign. I am a little uneasy with the framing, but after looking at your image for a while, I am not sure how you could have changed it and still gotten your point across. I guess one has  to sacrifice some artistic merit for humor. Fun shot.', '2004-11-29 23:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037103, 124492, 22384, '<td valign="top">On some levels this images looks better than Anna Nicole. Creative idea. What the heck did you use for her cleavage?</td>', 'On some levels this images looks better than Anna Nicole. Creative idea. What the heck did you use for her cleavage?', '2004-11-29 23:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037106, 123692, 22384, '<td valign="top">I tend to want to chomp on my dashboard more out of frustration at being stuck in traffic  than hunger. Creative idea which is enhanced by the fact that you have a beautiful young woman as your subject. One would expect a hulking male. Interesting twist.</td>', 'I tend to want to chomp on my dashboard more out of frustration at being stuck in traffic  than hunger. Creative idea which is enhanced by the fact that you have a beautiful young woman as your subject. One would expect a hulking male. Interesting twist.', '2004-11-29 23:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037107, 123307, 25468, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. Funny as hell. Great job. 10</td>', 'This is awesome. Funny as hell. Great job. 10', '2004-11-29 23:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037108, 124689, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Very Stan Laurel. The lighting and smile are perfect. Fun!</td>', 'Great shot. Very Stan Laurel. The lighting and smile are perfect. Fun!', '2004-11-29 23:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037109, 124454, 25468, '<td valign="top">Good stuff. I think alot of people missed the humor part of it but you thought this out and came up with something actually funny.</td>', 'Good stuff. I think alot of people missed the humor part of it but you thought this out and came up with something actually funny.', '2004-11-29 23:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037111, 124159, 25468, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s because the pic is so  small, but I really don''t see the humor.</td>', 'Maybe it''s because the pic is so  small, but I really don''t see the humor.', '2004-11-29 23:29:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1037112, 124656, 22384, '<td valign="top">The pained expression on the lion''s face makes the shot. Very observant. I think I would have just overlooked this image.</td>', 'The pained expression on the lion''s face makes the shot. Very observant. I think I would have just overlooked this image.', '2004-11-29 23:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037114, 124110, 25468, '<td valign="top">Pretty original idea and funny too! Another of only a handful of shots that met the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty original idea and funny too! Another of only a handful of shots that met the challenge.', '2004-11-29 23:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037115, 124055, 22384, '<td valign="top">This shot certainly made me do a double take when I saw it with all the others on the screen. I think if it were a crisper image, it would work very well.</td>', 'This shot certainly made me do a double take when I saw it with all the others on the screen. I think if it were a crisper image, it would work very well.', '2004-11-29 23:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037117, 124086, 22384, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot, so crisp. The contemplative look on the squirrel''s face along with your creative title are what make this image work. Funny.</td>', 'Really nice shot, so crisp. The contemplative look on the squirrel''s face along with your creative title are what make this image work. Funny.', '2004-11-29 23:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037121, 124024, 22384, '<td valign="top">As a mother of three daughters, I can certainly say that this image works for me. The whites, pale skin, and blonde hair work as a perfect foil for the red lips and lipstick. Stunning photo on many levels. Captivating shot!</td>', 'As a mother of three daughters, I can certainly say that this image works for me. The whites, pale skin, and blonde hair work as a perfect foil for the red lips and lipstick. Stunning photo on many levels. Captivating shot!', '2004-11-29 23:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037124, 123902, 22384, '<td valign="top">Okay, I just can''t seem to get this tree to grow for me. Fun idea. The color is sort of bland , and without your title I might have overlooked this image. Choose a contrasting color to make your image stand out.</td>', 'Okay, I just can''t seem to get this tree to grow for me. Fun idea. The color is sort of bland , and without your title I might have overlooked this image. Choose a contrasting color to make your image stand out.', '2004-11-29 23:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037126, 124315, 22384, '<td valign="top">Okay, so it took me a second, but then I got it. Very funny. The wooden floor/deck is a perfect choice and the theatrical lighting a brilliant touch.</td>', 'Okay, so it took me a second, but then I got it. Very funny. The wooden floor/deck is a perfect choice and the theatrical lighting a brilliant touch.', '2004-11-29 23:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037127, 124600, 22384, '<td valign="top">I gotta say, I love dog shots. The colors are perfect,and the dog is so crisp, except the tongue, which shows moement, so it does work. Great framing. Nice shot.</td>', 'I gotta say, I love dog shots. The colors are perfect,and the dog is so crisp, except the tongue, which shows moement, so it does work. Great framing. Nice shot.', '2004-11-29 23:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037132, 124031, 22384, '<td valign="top">This just confirms my feelings about cats. I get the feeling that they are always plotting to take over the world. A larger image would help. I got great advice on my last submission. Start out with at least one side of your image being 640 pixels and then work down from there until you get your image under 150. And, beware the feline.</td>', 'This just confirms my feelings about cats. I get the feeling that they are always plotting to take over the world. A larger image would help. I got great advice on my last submission. Start out with at least one side of your image being 640 pixels and then work down from there until you get your image under 150. And, beware the feline.', '2004-11-29 23:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037133, 124076, 25468, '<td valign="top">I guess I don''t see what''s so funny about some filthy pigeons on a rusty statue. sorry</td>', 'I guess I don''t see what''s so funny about some filthy pigeons on a rusty statue. sorry', '2004-11-29 23:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1037134, 124536, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The contemplative pose is perfect, and the image is technically stunning. I am eager to see your notes on this picture. Brilliant image.</td>', 'Great shot. The contemplative pose is perfect, and the image is technically stunning. I am eager to see your notes on this picture. Brilliant image.', '2004-11-29 23:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
