(1041396, 124370, 25655, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment: my favorite photo of this challenge!<br/>I love the concept, the focus and the colors!<br/>the only thing that''s a little bit distructing is the light forehead, although I''m not sure I can suggest of any way to fix this, since burning might cause loss of contrast...<br/>In any case - 10 from me!</td>', 'Returning for comment: my favorite photo of this challenge!I love the concept, the focus and the colors!the only thing that''s a little bit distructing is the light forehead, although I''m not sure I can suggest of any way to fix this, since burning might cause loss of contrast...In any case - 10 from me!', '2004-12-01 15:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1041406, 124156, 25655, '<td valign="top">Great image. made me laugh out loud.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great image. made me laugh out loud. ', '2004-12-01 15:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1041410, 124310, 25655, '<td valign="top">Nice image and a great idea.<br/>The only thing that''s distructing is the hot spot on the guy''s cheek in a too high contrast to the shadow on his neck. I think this could be fixed by just a little bit of burning and dodging. Anyway, got a 9 from me!</td>', 'Nice image and a great idea.The only thing that''s distructing is the hot spot on the guy''s cheek in a too high contrast to the shadow on his neck. I think this could be fixed by just a little bit of burning and dodging. Anyway, got a 9 from me!', '2004-12-01 15:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1041414, 124677, 25655, '<td valign="top">Very funny! Answers the challenge perfectly!<br/>the light under the goat''s head is very distructing hough and I wish it was burnt just a little bit... <br/>9 from me</td>', 'Very funny! Answers the challenge perfectly!the light under the goat''s head is very distructing hough and I wish it was burnt just a little bit... 9 from me', '2004-12-01 15:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
