(1041431, 124553, 25655, '<td valign="top">Great focus and a very nice image! I might increase the contrast a littl bit to get a real black to be contrasted to the very bright white at the bird''s wings and tail. But over all a very nice picture and with it''s title it fits the challenge nicely!<br/>8</td>', 'Great focus and a very nice image! I might increase the contrast a littl bit to get a real black to be contrasted to the very bright white at the bird''s wings and tail. But over all a very nice picture and with it''s title it fits the challenge nicely!8', '2004-12-01 15:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1041441, 124305, 25655, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh alright! :-))<br/>I think that the light spots on the front of the car are quite distructing and the focus is a bit lost. But other then that I like the lighting and the colors. 7<br/></td>', 'Made me laugh alright! :-))I think that the light spots on the front of the car are quite distructing and the focus is a bit lost. But other then that I like the lighting and the colors. 7', '2004-12-01 15:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1041443, 124490, 25655, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! I like the colors, the lighting and the concept itself! Fashion designers humor is a great one indeed :-)<br/>I think that the focus should have been on the right shoe  though. This one get the eye first and then the picture looks a little bit out of focus. Only at the second look the eye picks the show on the left, and it''s clarity and great focus. <br/>Over all a cool picture that answers the challenge nicely IMO. 7</td>', 'Nice shot! I like the colors, the lighting and the concept itself! Fashion designers humor is a great one indeed :-)I think that the focus should have been on the right shoe  though. This one get the eye first and then the picture looks a little bit out of focus. Only at the second look the eye picks the show on the left, and it''s clarity and great focus. Over all a cool picture that answers the challenge nicely IMO. 7', '2004-12-01 15:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1041451, 124508, 25655, '<td valign="top">Very funny! I like the warm colors and the lighting. A bit out of focus easpecially on the largest dog, which gets the eye first. but other then that a nice photo! 7<br/></td>', 'Very funny! I like the warm colors and the lighting. A bit out of focus easpecially on the largest dog, which gets the eye first. but other then that a nice photo! 7', '2004-12-01 15:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
