(1042661, 124541, 29269, '<td valign="top">It seems that, while the photo and idea are great, it could have been cropped differently. E.g. if less of the left side of the face (viewer''s right side) was showing, that would have improved the composition.(imho)</td>', 'It seems that, while the photo and idea are great, it could have been cropped differently. E.g. if less of the left side of the face (viewer''s right side) was showing, that would have improved the composition.(imho)', '2004-12-02 00:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042665, 123902, 29269, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I think that cropping out a piece of the bill at the very top was unnecessary. Also, the pot appears to be leaning to the right. I can see how straightening it would have effectively leaned the plant (tree:) to the left, but that''s what I would prefer. Hence only 7.</td>', 'Very nice! I think that cropping out a piece of the bill at the very top was unnecessary. Also, the pot appears to be leaning to the right. I can see how straightening it would have effectively leaned the plant (tree:) to the left, but that''s what I would prefer. Hence only 7.', '2004-12-02 00:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042670, 124664, 29269, '<td valign="top">The white (wall?) in the bottom left of the photo draws attention unnecessarily, and should have been cropped out (or, since this may not have been possible because of the top left, maybe rotating slightly clockwise and then cropping would have made this shot even better.</td>', 'The white (wall?) in the bottom left of the photo draws attention unnecessarily, and should have been cropped out (or, since this may not have been possible because of the top left, maybe rotating slightly clockwise and then cropping would have made this shot even better.', '2004-12-02 00:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
