(1043359, 124120, 29477, '<td valign="top">Love the expressions on both your subject''s faces and the composition of the how you took this image with the audience.  Good use of desaturation, however I would have gone the extra step to ensure that the blue jeans of the person in the black jacket was dulled to.  Once I noticed it, it became a distraction.  Still gave it a 7</td>', 'Love the expressions on both your subject''s faces and the composition of the how you took this image with the audience.  Good use of desaturation, however I would have gone the extra step to ensure that the blue jeans of the person in the black jacket was dulled to.  Once I noticed it, it became a distraction.  Still gave it a 7', '2004-12-02 13:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
