(1048102, 124636, 11078, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BrenB:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on 3rd.  This is so cute and she(I just saw on your post it''s a him) deserves something for posing this way. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you for all the comments and I had to laugh at the fact you thought it was a woman! <br/>Ian was just being a idiot and I really didn''t expect to get a ribbon but even our family thought he was funny! So thanks again for voting for my image. It has made my day!<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by BrenB: Congratulations on 3rd.  This is so cute and she(I just saw on your post it''s a him) deserves something for posing this way.  Thank you for all the comments and I had to laugh at the fact you thought it was a woman! Ian was just being a idiot and I really didn''t expect to get a ribbon but even our family thought he was funny! So thanks again for voting for my image. It has made my day!', '2004-12-06 00:47:34.000000', NULL, 0),
