(1048233, 124650, 24128, '<td valign="top">Come on Brad, be fair!<br/> <br/>I think that there needs to be an ammendment to the rules concerning anonymity in Brad''s case, I mean it''s bad enough to see that Brad has won yet another ribbon without having salt rubbed into my wounds by the fact that it was my highest vote given in the contest!<br/> <br/>Well done Brad....AGAIN!!! ;)</td>', 'Come on Brad, be fair! I think that there needs to be an ammendment to the rules concerning anonymity in Brad''s case, I mean it''s bad enough to see that Brad has won yet another ribbon without having salt rubbed into my wounds by the fact that it was my highest vote given in the contest! Well done Brad....AGAIN!!! ;)', '2004-12-06 02:02:35.000000', NULL, 0),
