(1048501, 124636, 472, '<td valign="top">i thought it was a woman too. i think it''s the hat.</td>', 'i thought it was a woman too. i think it''s the hat.', '2004-12-06 08:54:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1048511, 124668, 93, '<td valign="top">This got a 9 from me as well. Extremely funny shot, and *well* shot.<br/> <br/>No accounting for the idiocy of DPC voters though.</td>', 'This got a 9 from me as well. Extremely funny shot, and *well* shot. No accounting for the idiocy of DPC voters though.', '2004-12-06 09:10:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1048517, 124327, 93, '<td valign="top">A big thank you to everyone who commented.  Commenters on this image gave me an average of 7.556... non commenters a 5.155.<br/> <br/>That''s probably the largest difference in score between commenters and non-commenters I''ve ever had.<br/> <br/>I don''t understand why this did so poorly at all...  Totally, absolutely, completely blows my mind.  Yah, the figure in the background is a little motion-blurred in areas, but not where it counts. (hard to time the swinging of a camera strap when you have all of 10 seconds to get into the shot and pose it).   I just don''t get it.<br/> <br/>I didn''t expect 7s.. or even mid 6s.. but a 5.1?!  *shakes head*<br/> <br/>I''ll never understand what makes the masses happy.  I''m too deeply *me*.<br/>This.. is why I fail.</td>', 'A big thank you to everyone who commented.  Commenters on this image gave me an average of 7.556... non commenters a 5.155. That''s probably the largest difference in score between commenters and non-commenters I''ve ever had. I don''t understand why this did so poorly at all...  Totally, absolutely, completely blows my mind.  Yah, the figure in the background is a little motion-blurred in areas, but not where it counts. (hard to time the swinging of a camera strap when you have all of 10 seconds to get into the shot and pose it).   I just don''t get it. I didn''t expect 7s.. or even mid 6s.. but a 5.1?!  *shakes head* I''ll never understand what makes the masses happy.  I''m too deeply *me*.This.. is why I fail.', '2004-12-06 09:15:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1048529, 124650, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well, if - like you say - it''s a stuffed animal as opposed to a cuddly toy then you''re actually quite a sicko.  : )<br/> <br/>Excellent gag by Clubjuggle too!  :D<br/> <br/>Reminds me of when I went my snowboarding acouple of years back and my dear old cat became gravely sick. I came back to a £950 vet bill!! More than twice the cost of my trip (excluding beer). The poor old fella died in my arms that weekend too.  :(</td>', 'Well, if - like you say - it''s a stuffed animal as opposed to a cuddly toy then you''re actually quite a sicko.  : ) Excellent gag by Clubjuggle too!  :D Reminds me of when I went my snowboarding acouple of years back and my dear old cat became gravely sick. I came back to a £950 vet bill!! More than twice the cost of my trip (excluding beer). The poor old fella died in my arms that weekend too.  :(', '2004-12-06 09:21:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1048541, 124096, 24715, '<td valign="top">Great photo, Dan! One of the funniest in a bunch.</td>', 'Great photo, Dan! One of the funniest in a bunch.', '2004-12-06 09:31:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1048542, 124668, 20889, '<td valign="top">Well me and the wife had a good laugh and fun with it. It''s one of the better shots I have taken. Laughter is good to break up all the everyday crap that goes on. Can''t please everyone, and it was not intend to upset.<br/>I was not going for score, if you can just make a few smile, then you have done more than a ribbon. "Happy Shooting"</td>', 'Well me and the wife had a good laugh and fun with it. It''s one of the better shots I have taken. Laughter is good to break up all the everyday crap that goes on. Can''t please everyone, and it was not intend to upset.I was not going for score, if you can just make a few smile, then you have done more than a ribbon. "Happy Shooting"', '2004-12-06 09:33:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1048545, 124587, 24715, '<td valign="top">Thank you all who voted and left comments. I wonder how many people actually read it as "Touched by the Angel"? :-) I wanted to show how absurd something may be when one letter in the word is misplaced.<br/> <br/>I wish that angle tool was more visible than it is, but I could not do much about it since the bottom part of it is painted black and it blends in with the darkness.</td>', 'Thank you all who voted and left comments. I wonder how many people actually read it as "Touched by the Angel"? :-) I wanted to show how absurd something may be when one letter in the word is misplaced. I wish that angle tool was more visible than it is, but I could not do much about it since the bottom part of it is painted black and it blends in with the darkness.', '2004-12-06 09:37:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1048591, 124263, 29535, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, not bad I guess.  Maybe I have a warped sense of humour but I thought this would come much higher :p<br/> <br/>I felt quite bad, I had to suck the yolk out of the eye witha  syringe and then I just threw the poor guy away.  Shame.</td>', 'Hmmm, not bad I guess.  Maybe I have a warped sense of humour but I thought this would come much higher :p I felt quite bad, I had to suck the yolk out of the eye witha  syringe and then I just threw the poor guy away.  Shame.', '2004-12-06 10:09:49.000000', NULL, 0),
