(1048634, 124650, 9763, '<td valign="top">Funny shot!  Did you ever see <a href="//www.cat-scan.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.cat-scan.com</a> ?  I think that site is taken down.  It was one of the funniest sites on the web!  I miss it :)  I have 5 cats, but never once got a good scan of my kiddies.</td>', 'Funny shot!  Did you ever see //www.cat-scan.com ?  I think that site is taken down.  It was one of the funniest sites on the web!  I miss it :)  I have 5 cats, but never once got a good scan of my kiddies.', '2004-12-06 10:51:54.000000', NULL, 0),
