(1048674, 124650, 19708, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and all the comments.<br/>This finish could not have been funnier - it was better than the individual pictures! Thamer: ((hug)) - you deserve it!<br/> <br/>I had hoped it would end up with the mousetrap to the right and was even better with a Blue &amp; Red finish!<br/>Sorry to have duped everyone here. I desperately tried to find a cat, but none were to be found that had suitable limbs &amp; tail. Matt BTW, will be taking up residence in my home, and will be cared for properly - LOL<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-07 13:36:41.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the votes and all the comments.This finish could not have been funnier - it was better than the individual pictures! Thamer: ((hug)) - you deserve it! I had hoped it would end up with the mousetrap to the right and was even better with a Blue & Red finish!Sorry to have duped everyone here. I desperately tried to find a cat, but none were to be found that had suitable limbs & tail. Matt BTW, will be taking up residence in my home, and will be cared for properly - LOL', '2004-12-06 11:42:06.000000', '2004-12-07 13:36:41.000000', 0),
