(1048684, 123268, 19708, '<td valign="top">Thamer - this was one of the best laughs I''ve had in a very long time. It was a good thing I have great bladder control when I first saw this. I had no idea who was behind this. I was actually more curious as to who was behind it, than where mine ended up.<br/>I had hoped this would end up next to mine in one of the two ribbons positions to add to the humor, and they way it ended up was a forever <u>DPC Classic.</u> <br/><b>Thank You!</b></td>', 'Thamer - this was one of the best laughs I''ve had in a very long time. It was a good thing I have great bladder control when I first saw this. I had no idea who was behind this. I was actually more curious as to who was behind it, than where mine ended up.I had hoped this would end up next to mine in one of the two ribbons positions to add to the humor, and they way it ended up was a forever DPC Classic. Thank You!', '2004-12-06 12:11:44.000000', NULL, 0),
