(1049191, 124523, 16488, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all your kind comments!  I knew when I entered it that it was risky...there are a lot of new members here and some who take drops very seriously.  The humor isn''t evident and sarcasm, even when self-directed, can fall flat.  I have learned much with my "drops" photos and will probably produce more when the mood (or excuse) strikes me.<br/> <br/>Many asked what the little eyes were and where they came from.  I''ll post an image to explain soon.  (Just a little busy today with Yellow Revisited.)</td>', 'Thank you for all your kind comments!  I knew when I entered it that it was risky...there are a lot of new members here and some who take drops very seriously.  The humor isn''t evident and sarcasm, even when self-directed, can fall flat.  I have learned much with my "drops" photos and will probably produce more when the mood (or excuse) strikes me. Many asked what the little eyes were and where they came from.  I''ll post an image to explain soon.  (Just a little busy today with Yellow Revisited.)', '2004-12-06 18:20:13.000000', NULL, 0),
