(1049452, 124587, 19708, '<td valign="top">What can I say Giedrius. I missed it.<br/>I looked the picture over several times, with Touched by an "Angel" in my brain, and all I saw was what looked like the metal measuring device on a doctor''s scale.  Kept missing the humor in the picture alone.<br/>I was one of the <i>(gulp)</i> 23 that voted this a 4.</td>', 'What can I say Giedrius. I missed it.I looked the picture over several times, with Touched by an "Angel" in my brain, and all I saw was what looked like the metal measuring device on a doctor''s scale.  Kept missing the humor in the picture alone.I was one of the (gulp) 23 that voted this a 4.', '2004-12-06 21:20:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1049652, 124278, 22479, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your votes, everyone. I rushed this one and didn''t get it the way I would have liked, plus my friend didn''t want me to take more than a few tries. But I don''t mind the low score, it was all in good fun haha.</td>', 'Thanks for your votes, everyone. I rushed this one and didn''t get it the way I would have liked, plus my friend didn''t want me to take more than a few tries. But I don''t mind the low score, it was all in good fun haha.', '2004-12-06 22:52:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1049716, 124587, 1031, '<td valign="top">I caught the intentional "typo" right away, and I think having the lower black part fade out actully accentuates the illusion of his being struck by a beam from heaven. I would have thought that even the typical four-second viewing would have been long enough for more people to "get it."<br/> <br/>Still, although I''ll be happy next time <u>I</u> get a top-20 finish, this could easily have been a top-10.</td>', 'I caught the intentional "typo" right away, and I think having the lower black part fade out actully accentuates the illusion of his being struck by a beam from heaven. I would have thought that even the typical four-second viewing would have been long enough for more people to "get it." Still, although I''ll be happy next time I get a top-20 finish, this could easily have been a top-10.', '2004-12-06 23:59:36.000000', NULL, 0),
