(1051780, 124689, 8522, '<td valign="top"><b>Critique Club</b> <br/>Very effective b&amp;w... the moody use of lighting gives this humour a bit of a dark edge. The use of multiple exposures makes me visualise a macarbre jack-in-the-box with a human head bouncing from side to side on a spring. I think there''s something a bit sinister and threatening about the huge insincere smile. The spacing of the 3 heads is perfectly achieved, and I like the way the composition isn''t centered. Your lighting has given you some great catchlights. Great skin texture. Very imaginative, well done.</td>', 'Critique Club Very effective b&w... the moody use of lighting gives this humour a bit of a dark edge. The use of multiple exposures makes me visualise a macarbre jack-in-the-box with a human head bouncing from side to side on a spring. I think there''s something a bit sinister and threatening about the huge insincere smile. The spacing of the 3 heads is perfectly achieved, and I like the way the composition isn''t centered. Your lighting has given you some great catchlights. Great skin texture. Very imaginative, well done.', '2004-12-08 08:28:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1051786, 123607, 20102, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by graphicfunk:</b></div><hr/><i> Another funny image which should have finished much higher. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Definately!</td>', 'Originally posted by graphicfunk: Another funny image which should have finished much higher.   Definately!', '2004-12-08 08:34:37.000000', NULL, 0),
