(1052031, 124650, 318, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mavrik:</b></div><hr/><i> Dear Jon,<br/> <br/>Your lack of understanding why this won is why he has 9 ribbons and you have zero.  :)<br/> <br/>It was the best humor shot.<br/> <br/>M </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, it is funny. But this is photography contest, not humour. :/</td>', 'Originally posted by mavrik: Dear Jon, Your lack of understanding why this won is why he has 9 ribbons and you have zero.  :) It was the best humor shot. M   Yes, it is funny. But this is photography contest, not humour. :/', '2004-12-08 11:31:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1052101, 124650, 19708, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jonr:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>Yes, it is funny. But this is photography contest, not humour. :/ </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I will try in the future to buy some better equipment, like a softbox or two, reflectors, umbrellas, multiple strobes, better backdrop materials and perhaps even a better camera.<br/>Perhaps I should have shot this on the desk with all the clutter, or yet a white background to cut back on the light/dark contrasts.<br/>Perhaps I should have cropped this differently too. I tried to make sure it wasn''t static and dead center and at least my eyes are naturally drawn to the green light which falls in the realm of thirds.<br/> <br/>If you have suggestions, please offer them. I have no way to better my photographs without your help.</td>', 'Originally posted by jonr: Yes, it is funny. But this is photography contest, not humour. :/  I will try in the future to buy some better equipment, like a softbox or two, reflectors, umbrellas, multiple strobes, better backdrop materials and perhaps even a better camera.Perhaps I should have shot this on the desk with all the clutter, or yet a white background to cut back on the light/dark contrasts.Perhaps I should have cropped this differently too. I tried to make sure it wasn''t static and dead center and at least my eyes are naturally drawn to the green light which falls in the realm of thirds. If you have suggestions, please offer them. I have no way to better my photographs without your help.', '2004-12-08 12:01:12.000000', NULL, 0),
