(1052155, 124650, 23913, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BradP:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jonr:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>Yes, it is funny. But this is photography contest, not humour. :/ </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I will try in the future to buy some better equipment, like a softbox or two, reflectors, umbrellas, multiple strobes, better backdrop materials and perhaps even a better camera.<br/>Perhaps I should have shot this on the desk with all the clutter, or yet a white background to cut back on the light/dark contrasts.<br/>Perhaps I should have cropped this differently too. I tried to make sure it wasn''t static and dead center and at least my eyes are naturally drawn to the green light which falls in the realm of thirds.<br/> <br/>If you have suggestions, please offer them. I have no way to better my photographs without your help. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>yes i has a suggestion- Offer to meet jonr at a coffee shop then HIT HIM HARD, then if u feel like it HIT HIM AGAIN.....<br/>repeat untill u feel like he has had enough and you are happy.....Then HIT HIM FOR ME!<br/> <br/>great shot i like it and its funny so ignor others.</td>', 'Originally posted by BradP: Originally posted by jonr: Yes, it is funny. But this is photography contest, not humour. :/  I will try in the future to buy some better equipment, like a softbox or two, reflectors, umbrellas, multiple strobes, better backdrop materials and perhaps even a better camera.Perhaps I should have shot this on the desk with all the clutter, or yet a white background to cut back on the light/dark contrasts.Perhaps I should have cropped this differently too. I tried to make sure it wasn''t static and dead center and at least my eyes are naturally drawn to the green light which falls in the realm of thirds. If you have suggestions, please offer them. I have no way to better my photographs without your help.   yes i has a suggestion- Offer to meet jonr at a coffee shop then HIT HIM HARD, then if u feel like it HIT HIM AGAIN.....repeat untill u feel like he has had enough and you are happy.....Then HIT HIM FOR ME! great shot i like it and its funny so ignor others.', '2004-12-08 12:30:44.000000', NULL, 0),
